TplLabel    = Id ":" !":" ;
// Swift 4 let an interpolation carry SEVERAL values - `"[\\(x, x)]"` - and the
// parser still accepts them (Swift 5 warns that they no longer form a tuple). Only
// the first is interpolated here, which is the Swift 5 reading of the warning.
