    // interpreter's rtIsType), e as? T the value or nil, and e as / e as! T the value
    // itself - the value model has one representation per value, so an upcast and a
    // forced downcast are identities. An enum case answers to its enum's name.
    function makeCastOne(t, op, tname) {
